<title>USA: ProxyMed signs agreement with Prison Health.</title>
<headline>ProxyMed signs agreement with Prison Health.</headline>
<dateline>FT. LAUDERDALE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ProxyMed Inc said on Monday that it signed an agreement with Prison Health Systems Inc, a wholly-owned subsidiary of America Service Group Inc.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the three year licensing agreement, Prison Health Systems would use ProxyMed's ProxyScript technology to help manage the pharmacy component of the overall health benefit at two correctional facilities in Philadelphia.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
